{"audio": "james-05.opus", "duration_ms": 152266, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2180, "end_ms": 4620, "text": "James, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 4620, "end_ms": 9000, "text": "Come now, you who are rich, weep and wail over the misery to come upon you."}, {"start_ms": 9680, "end_ms": 12781, "text": "Your riches have rotted and moths have eaten your clothes."}, {"start_ms": 13281, "end_ms": 15101, "text": "Your gold and silver are corroded."}, {"start_ms": 15541, "end_ms": 19721, "text": "Their corrosion will testify against you and consume your flesh like fire."}, {"start_ms": 20281, "end_ms": 22361, "text": "You have hoarded treasure in the last days."}, {"start_ms": 22781, "end_ms": 27761, "text": "Look, the wages you withheld from the workmen who mowed your fields are crying out against you."}, {"start_ms": 28321, "end_ms": 31901, "text": "The cries of the harvesters have reached the ears of the Lord of Hosts."}, {"start_ms": 32681, "end_ms": 35361, "text": "You have lived on earth in luxury and self-indulgence."}, {"start_ms": 35581, "end_ms": 38001, "text": "You have fattened your hearts in the day of slaughter."}, {"start_ms": 38362, "end_ms": 41842, "text": "You have condemned and murdered the righteous, who did not resist you."}, {"start_ms": 42802, "end_ms": 45422, "text": "Be patient, then, brothers, until the Lord’s coming."}, {"start_ms": 45922, "end_ms": 51922, "text": "See how the farmer awaits the precious fruit of the soil—how patient he is for the fall and spring rains."}, {"start_ms": 52722, "end_ms": 56962, "text": "You, too, be patient and strengthen your hearts, because the Lord’s coming is near."}, {"start_ms": 57782, "end_ms": 61562, "text": "Do not complain about one another, brothers, so that you will not be judged."}, {"start_ms": 61922, "end_ms": 64423, "text": "Look, the Judge is standing at the door!"}, {"start_ms": 65143, "end_ms": 70463, "text": "Brothers, as an example of patience in affliction, take the prophets who spoke in the name of the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 71023, "end_ms": 73903, "text": "See how blessed we consider those who have persevered."}, {"start_ms": 74463, "end_ms": 78163, "text": "You have heard of Job’s perseverance and have seen the outcome from the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 78783, "end_ms": 81003, "text": "The Lord is full of compassion and mercy."}, {"start_ms": 82123, "end_ms": 86823, "text": "Above all, my brothers, do not swear, not by heaven or earth or by any other oath."}, {"start_ms": 87383, "end_ms": 92784, "text": "Simply let your “Yes” be yes, and your “No,” no, so that you will not fall under judgment."}, {"start_ms": 93984, "end_ms": 95204, "text": "Is any one of you suffering?"}, {"start_ms": 95504, "end_ms": 96164, "text": "He should pray."}, {"start_ms": 96624, "end_ms": 97584, "text": "Is anyone cheerful?"}, {"start_ms": 97884, "end_ms": 99124, "text": "He should sing praises."}, {"start_ms": 99644, "end_ms": 100704, "text": "Is any one of you sick?"}, {"start_ms": 101084, "end_ms": 105944, "text": "He should call the elders of the church to pray over him and anoint him with oil in the name of the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 106544, "end_ms": 109464, "text": "And the prayer offered in faith will restore the one who is sick."}, {"start_ms": 109964, "end_ms": 111164, "text": "The Lord will raise him up."}, {"start_ms": 111584, "end_ms": 113344, "text": "If he has sinned, he will be forgiven."}, {"start_ms": 114505, "end_ms": 119185, "text": "Therefore confess your sins to each other and pray for each other so that you may be healed."}, {"start_ms": 119925, "end_ms": 123225, "text": "The prayer of a righteous man has great power to prevail."}, {"start_ms": 124065, "end_ms": 125885, "text": "Elijah was a man just like us."}, {"start_ms": 126305, "end_ms": 131565, "text": "He prayed earnestly that it would not rain, and it did not rain on the land for three and a half years."}, {"start_ms": 132305, "end_ms": 136405, "text": "Again he prayed, and the heavens gave rain, and the earth yielded its crops."}, {"start_ms": 137685, "end_ms": 150866, "text": "My brothers, if one of you should wander from the truth and someone should bring him back, consider this: Whoever turns a sinner from the error of his way will save his soul from death and cover over a multitude of sins."}], "words": [{"t": "James,", "s": 2180, "e": 2580, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2680, "e": 3000, "si": 0}, {"t": "Five.", "s": 3060, "e": 4620, "si": 0}, {"t": "Come", "s": 4620, "e": 4840, "si": 1}, {"t": "now,", "s": 4880, "e": 5080, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 5220, "e": 5360, "si": 1}, {"t": "who", "s": 5460, "e": 5560, "si": 1}, {"t": "are", "s": 5660, "e": 5780, "si": 1}, {"t": "rich,", "s": 5860, "e": 6120, "si": 1}, {"t": "weep", "s": 6520, "e": 6780, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 6840, "e": 6960, "si": 1}, {"t": "wail", "s": 7060, "e": 7360, "si": 1}, {"t": "over", "s": 7440, "e": 7600, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7620, "e": 7720, "si": 1}, {"t": "misery", "s": 7780, "e": 8140, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 8220, "e": 8280, "si": 1}, {"t": "come", "s": 8340, "e": 8520, "si": 1}, {"t": "upon", "s": 8540, "e": 8820, "si": 1}, {"t": "you.", "s": 8880, "e": 9000, "si": 1}, {"t": "Your", "s": 9680, "e": 9820, "si": 2}, {"t": "riches", "s": 9880, "e": 10300, "si": 2}, {"t": "have", "s": 10360, "e": 10520, "si": 2}, {"t": "rotted", "s": 10620, "e": 11020, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 11080, "e": 11200, "si": 2}, {"t": "moths", "s": 11260, "e": 11720, "si": 2}, {"t": "have", "s": 11760, "e": 11900, "si": 2}, {"t": "eaten", "s": 11940, "e": 12120, "si": 2}, {"t": "your", "s": 12160, "e": 12280, "si": 2}, {"t": "clothes.", "s": 12320, "e": 12781, "si": 2}, {"t": "Your", "s": 13281, "e": 13401, "si": 3}, {"t": "gold", "s": 13461, "e": 13721, "si": 3}, {"t": "and", "s": 13801, "e": 13921, "si": 3}, {"t": "silver", "s": 14021, "e": 14301, "si": 3}, {"t": "are", "s": 14441, "e": 14561, "si": 3}, {"t": "corroded.", "s": 14581, "e": 15101, "si": 3}, {"t": "Their", "s": 15541, "e": 